TRIPWIRE — DO NOT DELETE

This is a FILE, not a directory, on purpose. The Vercel CLI cannot create its
`.vercel/` link directory while a regular file occupies that name, so
`vercel link` / `vercel --prod` / `vercel deploy` will FAIL here.

That is intended. This folder is RETIRED. See RETIRED.md.

